1
00:00:06,861 --> 00:00:08,061
Make a fist.

2
00:00:08,151 --> 00:00:13,117
Feel it, tight and hard. Now open
your hand. Where did the fist go?

3
00:00:13,921 --> 00:00:16,531
No one has ever asked
that question seriously.

4
00:00:16,611 --> 00:00:18,492
And yet, a fist can hit.

5
00:00:19,314 --> 00:00:22,101
I am John Tan, known as Thusness.

6
00:00:22,181 --> 00:00:26,372
These are my own notes, from my
own practice and contemplation.

7
00:00:27,217 --> 00:00:29,556
For years I have said it in many ways.

8
00:00:29,636 --> 00:00:33,197
The chariot has no essence,
yet it still carries.

9
00:00:33,277 --> 00:00:36,417
There is no wind, yet the blowing is felt.

10
00:00:36,497 --> 00:00:38,881
The breeze is still cold on the skin.

11
00:00:39,685 --> 00:00:43,640
I have come to see that these
sentences disturb more than they open.

12
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:47,241
The mind cannot wrap around
them. It hears a paradox.

13
00:00:47,321 --> 00:00:51,724
Either it files the paradox away
as something deep and unclear,

14
00:00:51,804 --> 00:00:53,953
or it rejects it as nonsense.

15
00:00:54,033 --> 00:00:56,769
Either way, the insight does not land.

16
00:00:57,582 --> 00:01:02,747
There is a gap here. Something has to be
seen before such sentences can make sense.

17
00:01:02,827 --> 00:01:06,837
And I have often stated the conclusion
without showing how it works.

18
00:01:06,917 --> 00:01:11,759
Even someone with a clear insight into
no-self can be left with this gap.

19
00:01:12,573 --> 00:01:14,476
Look closely at the sentence.

20
00:01:14,556 --> 00:01:18,136
The chariot has no essence,
yet it still carries.

21
00:01:18,937 --> 00:01:20,718
It does two things at once.

22
00:01:20,798 --> 00:01:24,033
It keeps the chariot as the
subject of the sentence.

23
00:01:24,113 --> 00:01:27,131
And it empties that subject: no essence.

24
00:01:27,211 --> 00:01:29,835
What is left is a chariot minus its core,

25
00:01:29,915 --> 00:01:32,199
which still somehow does the carrying.

26
00:01:32,279 --> 00:01:35,967
A hollow thing, pushing a
load. A ghost that acts.

27
00:01:36,773 --> 00:01:41,126
So the mind asks, quite reasonably:
then what does the carrying?

28
00:01:41,937 --> 00:01:45,213
And whatever I answer,
conditions, the parts,

29
00:01:45,293 --> 00:01:49,751
the process, is heard as a new
thing put in the empty place.

30
00:01:49,831 --> 00:01:51,544
The gap is not closed.

31
00:01:51,624 --> 00:01:53,858
It is only filled with something new.

32
00:01:54,661 --> 00:01:59,064
The word that does the damage
is despite. Or yet. Or still.

33
00:01:59,144 --> 00:02:01,768
It sets the working against the emptiness,

34
00:02:01,848 --> 00:02:04,757
as if things worked in
spite of lacking something.

35
00:02:04,837 --> 00:02:09,843
As long as the sentence has that shape,
more explanation only makes it worse.

36
00:02:10,662 --> 00:02:12,648
The problem is not the insight.

37
00:02:12,728 --> 00:02:14,962
It is the grammar I
have been saying it in.

38
00:02:15,778 --> 00:02:19,317
Why does even the insight
of no-self leave this gap?

39
00:02:20,137 --> 00:02:24,676
No-self, as I have known it,
usually sees through one side.

40
00:02:24,756 --> 00:02:28,277
In seeing, no seer is
found behind the seeing.

41
00:02:28,357 --> 00:02:31,184
In hearing, no hearer behind the hearing.

42
00:02:31,264 --> 00:02:35,070
There is just the seen and
the heard, vivid and complete.

43
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:37,629
It is a real and freeing insight.

44
00:02:38,442 --> 00:02:40,713
But the other side can stay untouched.

45
00:02:40,793 --> 00:02:44,558
The tree that is seen still seems
to stand there from its own side.

46
00:02:44,638 --> 00:02:47,072
The chariot still seems to push the load.

47
00:02:47,152 --> 00:02:50,758
A cause still seems to hold a
power it hands to its effect.

48
00:02:51,561 --> 00:02:54,429
So a person can have a
clear taste of no-self,

49
00:02:54,509 --> 00:02:58,369
and still picture the world in
the old way. The seer has gone.

50
00:02:58,449 --> 00:03:00,394
The seen has not been looked into.

51
00:03:00,474 --> 00:03:03,532
The same insight has to
be extended to everything.

52
00:03:03,612 --> 00:03:07,477
The emptiness of self, and
the emptiness of phenomena.

53
00:03:08,333 --> 00:03:11,913
Four insights, in my
experience, are what it takes.

54
00:03:12,726 --> 00:03:17,556
The first insight. The name is drawn
from the working. It is not added to it.

55
00:03:18,357 --> 00:03:20,292
Habit puts things in this order.

56
00:03:20,408 --> 00:03:23,240
First there is a chariot,
and then it carries.

57
00:03:23,357 --> 00:03:25,999
First there is a wind, and then it blows.

58
00:03:26,809 --> 00:03:29,922
In experience, the order
is the other way round.

59
00:03:30,002 --> 00:03:34,650
There is the carrying: wheels turning,
the load moving along the road.

60
00:03:34,730 --> 00:03:37,544
Chariot is the name
drawn from that carrying.

61
00:03:37,624 --> 00:03:41,484
There is the blowing: coolness
moving across the skin,

62
00:03:41,564 --> 00:03:43,984
leaves stirring, a door creaking.

63
00:03:44,064 --> 00:03:46,774
Wind is the name drawn from that blowing.

64
00:03:47,586 --> 00:03:50,917
So it is not, no wind, yet blowing.

65
00:03:50,997 --> 00:03:53,471
The blowing is the wind, completely.

66
00:03:53,551 --> 00:03:56,596
The cold on my skin is
not a sign of the wind,

67
00:03:56,676 --> 00:03:58,960
pointing to a wind somewhere behind it.

68
00:03:59,040 --> 00:04:02,330
It is all the wind there
ever was. Nothing is missing.

69
00:04:02,410 --> 00:04:04,359
So nothing needs to be explained.

70
00:04:05,169 --> 00:04:08,975
This is the same insight as,
the flashing is the lightning,

71
00:04:09,055 --> 00:04:11,121
now turned to the object side.

72
00:04:11,201 --> 00:04:15,265
When it rains, there is no it
that rains. There is the raining.

73
00:04:15,345 --> 00:04:16,873
River names the flowing.

74
00:04:17,690 --> 00:04:19,349
The name does real work.

75
00:04:19,429 --> 00:04:22,515
It picks out a pattern that
comes back and matters to us,

76
00:04:22,595 --> 00:04:26,415
so we can speak of it and use
it. But it picks out the working.

77
00:04:26,495 --> 00:04:30,183
It does not point past the
working, to a core that does it.

78
00:04:31,014 --> 00:04:34,145
The second insight. You
already live this logic.

79
00:04:34,965 --> 00:04:37,833
None of this is strange in easy cases.

80
00:04:37,913 --> 00:04:39,885
A fist can hit, hard.

81
00:04:39,965 --> 00:04:43,462
When the hand opens, no one
asks where the fist went.

82
00:04:43,579 --> 00:04:46,003
Fist names the hand, clenched.

83
00:04:46,825 --> 00:04:52,261
Your cat sits on your lap. Stand up, and
the lap is gone. It did not go anywhere.

84
00:04:52,341 --> 00:04:53,556
Lap names sitting.

85
00:04:54,365 --> 00:04:55,942
A wave can knock you over.

86
00:04:56,022 --> 00:04:59,896
Look for the wave apart from the
water moving, and there is nothing.

87
00:04:59,976 --> 00:05:03,229
Yet no one feels the wave
is any weaker for that.

88
00:05:04,041 --> 00:05:06,542
A traffic jam makes you late for work.

89
00:05:06,622 --> 00:05:09,953
It has no core, no edge and no owner.

90
00:05:10,033 --> 00:05:15,663
It is cars, roads, the hour and the
drivers, meeting. It still makes you late.

91
00:05:16,463 --> 00:05:21,265
A melody moves you. A rainbow is
photographed. A team wins the cup.

92
00:05:22,073 --> 00:05:27,142
In every one of these, you already accept
that something works fully with no essence

93
00:05:27,222 --> 00:05:30,068
of its own. And you are
not disturbed at all.

94
00:05:30,898 --> 00:05:35,941
The chariot, the apple, the body and
the self have the same structure.

95
00:05:36,021 --> 00:05:40,193
The only difference is that they are
more stable, and come back more often.

96
00:05:40,273 --> 00:05:41,932
A fist lasts seconds.

97
00:05:42,012 --> 00:05:43,726
A chariot lasts years.

98
00:05:43,806 --> 00:05:45,601
A body, a lifetime.

99
00:05:45,681 --> 00:05:50,248
Because they are stable and repeated,
the habit has hardened around them,

100
00:05:50,328 --> 00:05:52,467
and the name has come
to feel like a thing.

101
00:05:53,294 --> 00:05:55,565
So nothing new is being asked of you.

102
00:05:55,645 --> 00:05:59,519
Only that you notice where you
stopped using a logic you already use.

103
00:05:59,599 --> 00:06:00,963
And why you stopped there.

104
00:06:01,794 --> 00:06:05,102
The third insight. An essence
would stop the carrying.

105
00:06:05,913 --> 00:06:07,504
Turn the argument round.

106
00:06:07,584 --> 00:06:11,879
Suppose the chariot did have an
essence, a nature of its own,

107
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:15,171
complete and independent.
What could it do?

108
00:06:15,973 --> 00:06:20,662
It could not be built, because something
complete in itself needs no parts and no

109
00:06:20,742 --> 00:06:24,779
builder. It could not move,
because moving is changing,

110
00:06:24,859 --> 00:06:27,088
and a fixed nature does not change.

111
00:06:27,168 --> 00:06:30,757
It could not carry, because
carrying is meeting the load,

112
00:06:30,837 --> 00:06:32,781
the road and the horse.

113
00:06:32,861 --> 00:06:36,196
And something sealed in its
own nature could meet nothing.

114
00:06:37,001 --> 00:06:39,489
This is Nāgārjuna's own turn.

115
00:06:39,569 --> 00:06:42,641
If you see things as
existing by their own nature,

116
00:06:42,721 --> 00:06:46,201
you see them as needing
no causes or conditions.

117
00:06:46,281 --> 00:06:49,638
And if all this were not empty,
there would be no arising,

118
00:06:49,718 --> 00:06:51,391
and no passing away.

119
00:06:51,471 --> 00:06:57,471
Every link that was feared to break under
emptiness is broken instead by own-nature.

120
00:06:58,293 --> 00:07:02,099
So the carrying does not happen
despite the lack of an essence.

121
00:07:02,179 --> 00:07:04,848
It is something an essence
would make impossible.

122
00:07:05,678 --> 00:07:07,310
I am careful with the wording.

123
00:07:07,390 --> 00:07:11,441
I do not say, because the
chariot is empty, it carries.

124
00:07:11,521 --> 00:07:16,060
Emptiness is not a power behind the
carrying. Emptiness does nothing.

125
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:20,286
I say: the chariot carries, and
what carries is found empty.

126
00:07:20,366 --> 00:07:22,070
An essence would have stopped it.

127
00:07:22,890 --> 00:07:26,918
The fourth insight. Then what
carries, is the it question again.

128
00:07:27,729 --> 00:07:31,322
Even after all this, a
question tends to come back.

129
00:07:31,424 --> 00:07:33,930
Fine. But then what is it that carries?

130
00:07:34,741 --> 00:07:36,740
Look at how this question is built.

131
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:39,389
It asks for a carrier behind the carrying.

132
00:07:39,469 --> 00:07:42,935
It has already put an it there,
before any answer is given.

133
00:07:43,015 --> 00:07:46,445
Whatever I answer, it will
be heard as the carrier.

134
00:07:47,262 --> 00:07:49,900
So I do not answer it. I show what it is.

135
00:07:49,980 --> 00:07:54,207
The carrying is wheels, axle, road, load,

136
00:07:54,287 --> 00:07:57,699
the horse's pull and the
driver's purpose, meeting.

137
00:07:57,779 --> 00:08:00,701
Nothing extra stands
behind them doing the work.

138
00:08:00,781 --> 00:08:05,022
Conditions work, and no power
is found sitting in any of them.

139
00:08:05,102 --> 00:08:07,590
Nor do they add up to
a new hidden carrier.

140
00:08:07,670 --> 00:08:10,488
They are the carrying, described in parts.

141
00:08:11,314 --> 00:08:15,786
Seen as the habit, the same habit
that puts a self behind the seeing,

142
00:08:15,866 --> 00:08:21,560
the question simply stops coming up. It
is not answered. It loses its object.

143
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:24,826
Like asking where the fist
went, when the hand opened.

144
00:08:25,633 --> 00:08:27,305
Arguments can only point.

145
00:08:27,385 --> 00:08:29,198
This has to be met directly.

146
00:08:30,005 --> 00:08:32,574
Next time there is a breeze, feel it.

147
00:08:32,654 --> 00:08:36,609
The coolness on your face. The
moving. The slight pressure.

148
00:08:36,689 --> 00:08:38,770
Then ask: is anything missing?

149
00:08:38,850 --> 00:08:42,307
What would a wind add to this,
if there were one behind it?

150
00:08:43,113 --> 00:08:45,424
Look honestly. Nothing would be added.

151
00:08:45,504 --> 00:08:49,627
The coolness and the moving are
complete. Wind is the name for them.

152
00:08:50,437 --> 00:08:54,800
Do the same with a cup of tea in
your hand. The warmth. The weight.

153
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:59,125
The tilt to your lips. The taste.
What would a cup essence add?

154
00:08:59,945 --> 00:09:03,316
If you have tasted no-self,
this will feel familiar.

155
00:09:03,396 --> 00:09:06,482
It is the same seeing,
now turned to the seen.

156
00:09:06,562 --> 00:09:08,877
Nothing is missing, on either side.

157
00:09:09,693 --> 00:09:12,914
I want to say plainly how
serious I have found this to be.

158
00:09:12,994 --> 00:09:17,153
As a practitioner, during my own
journey and in my own journals,

159
00:09:17,233 --> 00:09:21,248
I have come to see this way of
speaking as a major disservice.

160
00:09:22,057 --> 00:09:26,664
Many teachers and writers on emptiness
fall into it without knowing it.

161
00:09:26,744 --> 00:09:31,352
And I am one of them. My own books
and articles said, not found,

162
00:09:31,432 --> 00:09:35,170
yet it carries you. A car
with no essence still injures.

163
00:09:35,250 --> 00:09:39,590
How a world without essence
still appears. Again and again.

164
00:09:40,397 --> 00:09:44,434
Each time, the sentence kept the
it, while trying to remove it.

165
00:09:44,514 --> 00:09:47,328
And it left the reader
with a ghost that acts.

166
00:09:47,408 --> 00:09:50,724
It makes the view sound like
a paradox to be accepted,

167
00:09:50,804 --> 00:09:54,003
or a mystery to be revered. It is neither.

168
00:09:54,838 --> 00:09:59,269
Someone who is serious about a
non-substantialist view deserves sentences

169
00:09:59,349 --> 00:10:03,794
that do not quietly rebuild the
substance they are meant to dissolve.

170
00:10:03,874 --> 00:10:05,519
So this must be corrected.

171
00:10:05,599 --> 00:10:07,480
I have begun with my own writing.

172
00:10:08,306 --> 00:10:10,006
This has changed how I write.

173
00:10:10,086 --> 00:10:15,771
Instead of, the chariot has no essence,
yet it still carries, I now say:

174
00:10:16,590 --> 00:10:21,076
The chariot carries. Chariot is
the name for this carrying: wheels,

175
00:10:21,156 --> 00:10:24,092
axle, road and load, meeting.

176
00:10:24,172 --> 00:10:29,078
Look for a chariot behind the carrying,
and none is found. None is needed.

177
00:10:29,158 --> 00:10:30,781
One would only get in the way.

178
00:10:31,605 --> 00:10:35,959
And instead of, there is no
wind, yet the blowing is felt:

179
00:10:36,782 --> 00:10:38,795
The breeze is cold on my skin.

180
00:10:38,875 --> 00:10:42,640
That coldness, that
moving, is what wind names.

181
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:45,837
There is no wind behind
it that the blowing needs.

182
00:10:46,637 --> 00:10:48,731
Others have seen the grammar sharply.

183
00:10:48,811 --> 00:10:53,282
Nietzsche wrote that the popular mind
separates the lightning from its flash,

184
00:10:53,362 --> 00:10:58,065
as if a doer stood behind the
deed, when the deed is everything.

185
00:10:58,145 --> 00:11:00,008
I share his reading of the grammar.

186
00:11:00,088 --> 00:11:04,342
Where I part from him: the doing that
remains is not a new ground either.

187
00:11:04,422 --> 00:11:07,118
It too is named, and not found.

188
00:11:07,929 --> 00:11:10,498
And the oldest image
is still the clearest.

189
00:11:10,578 --> 00:11:15,376
Asked where his chariot is, the monk
Nāgasena shows King Milinda that it is not

190
00:11:15,456 --> 00:11:19,900
the pole, not the axle, not
the wheels, not the frame,

191
00:11:19,980 --> 00:11:22,849
not their sum, and not
something apart from them.

192
00:11:22,929 --> 00:11:26,440
Chariot is a name, used
in dependence on these.

193
00:11:27,253 --> 00:11:29,962
And it was in that chariot
that the king had come.

194
00:11:30,761 --> 00:11:33,235
Open your hand. Nothing is lost.

195
00:11:33,315 --> 00:11:35,857
No fist was ever hiding in the hand.

196
00:11:35,937 --> 00:11:38,484
And the hand is free to make a fist again.

197
00:11:39,285 --> 00:11:42,293
Next: The Mind Trap and the Bottom Layer.

